> Here’s a concrete plan that should work well at the table and be doable with AI tools you already like.
> 
> I’ll give you:
> 
> 1. A **simple zone-based map design** for the Howling Crack.  
> 2. **Two workflows**:  
>    - A: DALL·E prompt set for a single “master map” + masked reveal.  
>    - B: Stable Diffusion / AUTOMATIC1111 approach (I suspect you’ll prefer this).  
> 3. Exact **prompt text** you can paste into DALL·E or SD.
