> ## 3. Quick Index (Room → Encounter)
> 
> Just to help your mental map when running:
> 
> - **A2 Guard Tunnel:** Mine Bats (E1)  
> - **A3 Junction:** Mine Gremlins (E2) or Tunnel Vermin (E9)  
> - **A3s Locker Room:** No combat unless you add rats (E9)  
> - **B2 Rubble Creep:** Cave Creepers (E3)  
> - **B4 Break Room:** Animated Tools (E4)  
> - **C2 Crystal Cavern:** Safe; no combat  
> - **C3 Gem Cutters:** Crystal Sprites (E5)  
> - **D2 Rope Bridge:** Wind Wisps (E6)  
